WEBVTT

00:03:30.225 --> 00:03:33.558
And the first surgery of the day
happened to be an obstetrical case.

00:03:33.582 --> 00:03:36.565
A woman came in,
she needed an emergency C-section

00:03:36.589 --> 00:03:39.318
to save her life and the life of her baby.

00:03:39.805 --> 00:03:41.759
And everything began pretty auspiciously.

00:03:41.783 --> 00:03:44.036
The surgeon was on call and scrubbed in.

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:45.348
The nurse was there.

00:03:45.372 --> 00:03:48.233
She was able to anesthetize her quickly,
and it was important

00:03:48.257 --> 00:03:50.593
because of the emergency
nature of the situation.

00:03:50.617 --> 00:03:52.334
And everything began well

00:03:52.358 --> 00:03:54.430
until the power went out.

00:03:55.773 --> 00:03:57.597
And now in the middle of this surgery,

00:03:57.621 --> 00:04:00.690
the surgeon is racing
against the clock to finish his case,